model cb07
  tally 1
  on 2026-10-19
  note "Ministerstwo Finansów, Objaśnienia podatkowe of 29 April 2021 on tax residence, Przykłady 8-13: the 183-day count (8), a change of residence during the year (9, 10), the Poland-UK method change under the MLI (11), and the treaty tie-breakers with Spain (12) and Canada (13)."
  note "The centre of vital interests, a permanent home, closer ties, an habitual abode and residence under a state's own law are the source's findings, entered as rows. Przykłady 9 and 10 state no year, so their dates are assumed to fall in 2020; no result depends on the year."
  note "Julia's Belarusian nationality and her move to Germany (Przykład 8), and Monika's UK work facts (Przykład 11), are read by nothing and not entered. Przykład 11 gives no amounts, so its tax and credit are written as steps over holes."
  note "The law's rows and rules come from the acts and treaties as published in the Dziennik Ustaw. The consolidated PIT texts the case quotes (Dz.U. 2021 poz. 1128, Dz.U. 2020 poz. 1426) and the MF's synthesised texts of the treaties with the MLI are only their locators (LANGUAGE 5.3)."

source dz1982_127 "Umowa między Rządem Polskiej Rzeczypospolitej Ludowej a Rządem Hiszpanii o unikaniu podwójnego opodatkowania w zakresie podatków od dochodu i majątku, podpisana w Madrycie dnia 15 listopada 1979 r. (Dz. U. z 1982 r. Nr 17, poz. 127)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1982/127"

source dz2006_1588 "Ustawa z dnia 16 listopada 2006 r. o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz o zmianie niektórych innych ustaw (Dz. U. Nr 217, poz. 1588)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2006/1588/text.pdf"

source dz2006_1840 "Konwencja między Rzecząpospolitą Polską a Zjednoczonym Królestwem Wielkiej Brytanii i Irlandii Północnej w sprawie unikania podwójnego opodatkowania ..., podpisana w Londynie dnia 20 lipca 2006 r. (Dz. U. Nr 250, poz. 1840)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2006/1840"

source dz2013_1371 "Konwencja między Rzecząpospolitą Polską a Kanadą w sprawie unikania podwójnego opodatkowania ... wraz z Protokołem, podpisane w Ottawie dnia 14 maja 2012 r. (Dz. U. z 2013 r. poz. 1371)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2013/1371"

source dz2018_1369 "Konwencja wielostronna implementująca środki traktatowego prawa podatkowego mające na celu zapobieganie erozji podstawy opodatkowania i przenoszeniu zysku, sporządzona w Paryżu dnia 24 listopada 2016 r. (MLI; Dz. U. z 2018 r. poz. 1369)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2018/1369"

source dz2018_1370 "Oświadczenie rządowe z dnia 6 czerwca 2018 r. w sprawie mocy obowiązującej Konwencji wielostronnej (MLI) (Dz. U. z 2018 r. poz. 1370)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2018/1370/text.pdf"

source dz2018_2253 "Oświadczenie rządowe z dnia 11 października 2018 r. w sprawie mocy obowiązującej w relacjach między Rzecząpospolitą Polską a Zjednoczonym Królestwem Konwencji wielostronnej (MLI) oraz jej zastosowania w realizacji postanowień Konwencji z dnia 20 lipca 2006 r. (Dz. U. z 2018 r. poz. 2253)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2018/2253/text.pdf"

source dz2019_1835 "Ustawa z dnia 30 sierpnia 2019 r. o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz ustawy o zmianie ustawy o podatku dochodowym od osób fizycznych oraz niektórych innych ustaw (Dz. U. poz. 1835)" at "https://api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2019/1835/text.pdf"

source mf_objasnienia "Objaśnienia podatkowe z dnia 29 kwietnia 2021 r. Rezydencja podatkowa oraz zakres obowiązku podatkowego osób fizycznych w Polsce (Minister Finansów, Funduszy i Polityki Regionalnej)" at "https://www.gov.pl/attachment/8f2d0cf1-ee3c-49a4-ae8e-e41c4fb19df7"

axis abolition_use
  used "Monika claims the ulga abolicyjna for 2020, shown in PIT/O"
  unused "Monika doesn't claim the ulga abolicyjna for 2020"

index cy = year 2019..2020

index form = [pit36, pit_zg, pit_o]

index method = [exemption_progression, proportional_credit]

index person = [julia, mariusz, dawid, monika, renata, jakub]

index state = [pol, gbr, swe, esp, can]

input abode[p in person, s in state]: bool
  note "has an habitual abode in that state (art. 4 ust. 2 lit. b of both treaties)"

input arrived[p in person]: date
  note "the first day in Poland of an unbroken stay"

input centre_from[p in person]: key state
  note "the state of the centre of vital interests before the move, as the source finds it"

input centre_to[p in person]: key state
  note "the state of the centre of vital interests after the move, as the source finds it"

input closer[p in person, s in state]: bool
  note "personal and economic relations are closer with that state than with the other (ośrodek interesów życiowych), as the source finds it; false for both when they are equal"

input domestic_res[p in person, s in state]: bool
  note "resident of that state under its own law, as the source finds it"

input home[p in person, s in state]: bool
  note "has a permanent home available in that state (art. 4 ust. 2 lit. a of both treaties)"

input household_moved[p in person]: date
  note "the day the person's household moved abroad to stay"

input income_other[p in person, y in cy]: money PLN question "What income other than from the UK did this person have in the year? Przykład 11 gives no amounts for 2020."

input income_uk[p in person, y in cy]: money PLN question "What income did this person earn in the UK in the year, in złoty at the rates of art. 11a? Przykład 11 gives no amounts or exchange rates."

input kz_full: money PLN

input last_present[p in person]: date
  note "the last day in Poland of an unbroken stay"

input mli_in_force[s in state]: date
  note "the day the MLI entered into force for that state (MLI art. 34)"

input national[p in person, s in state]: bool

input other_state[p in person]: key state
  note "the other state that treats the person as its resident"

input stay_limit: int

input tax_base[p in person, y in cy]: money PLN question "What is this person's tax base for the year (podstawa obliczenia podatku), the UK income included? Przykład 11 gives no amounts."

input tax_uk[p in person, y in cy]: money PLN question "What UK tax was paid on the year's UK income, in złoty? Przykład 11 gives no amounts, nor which part of the UK tax year falls in the calendar year."

input work_abroad_from[p in person]: date

band kz(x: money PLN): num PLN
  note "kwota zmniejszająca podatek, art. 27 ust. 1a"

band scale(x: money PLN): num PLN
  note "skala podatkowa, art. 27 ust. 1"

def abolition_right[y in cy]: bool
  note "MF, Przykład 11: under the proportional credit method she may claim the ulga abolicyjna, shown in PIT/O"
  rule base v mf2021 = ? "Is the ulga abolicyjna open in a year under the exemption method? The source doesn't say."
  rule credit excepts base v mf2021 when ukmethod[y] = proportional_credit = true

def centre_moved[p in person]: date
  note "MF, Przykłady 9 and 10: the centre of vital interests moves with the household: Mariusz's one-person household on the day he moved, Dawid's when his wife and children arrived in Sweden to stay"
  rule household v mf2021 = household_moved[p]

def days_pl[p in person, y in cy]: int
  note "MF section 2.2: days of physical presence in each calendar year; the day of arrival, the day of departure and any part of a day count"
  rule base v mf2021 = overlap_days(arrived[p], last_present[p], y)

def dual[p in person]: bool = domestic_res[p, pol] and domestic_res[p, other_state[p]]

def first_mli_year: key cy = first(y in cy where ukmethod[y] = proportional_credit)

def income_all[p in person, y in cy]: money PLN = income_other[p, y] + income_uk[p, y]

def left_pl[p in person]: bool
  note "art. 3 ust. 1a pkt 1: residence by the centre of vital interests ends when the centre leaves Poland; the 183-day limb (pkt 2) is not counted, as in the source"
  rule base v pit_2006 = (centre_from[p] = pol and centre_to[p] != pol)

def long_stay[p in person, y in cy]: bool
  note "art. 3 ust. 1a pkt 2: more than 183 days in Poland in the tax year"
  rule base v pit_2006 = days_pl[p, y] > stay_limit

def method_change_day: date = start_of(first_mli_year)

def mli_from: date
  note "MLI art. 35 ust. 1 lit. b): for taxes other than withholding taxes, the MLI applies to taxable periods beginning on or after six calendar months from the latest of the days it entered into force for the two states"
  rule base v mli = add_months(max(mli_in_force[pol], mli_in_force[gbr]), 6)

def must_file[f in form, y in cy]: bool
  note "MF, Przykład 11: under the proportional credit method she must file PIT-36 with PIT/ZG whether or not she has other income taxable in Poland; PIT/O shows the ulga abolicyjna if she claims it"
  rule base v mf2021 = ? "Which returns does a year under the exemption method need? The source says only that she filed none for 2019, having no other income."
  rule credit excepts base v mf2021 when ukmethod[y] = proportional_credit and f != pit_o = true
  rule relief excepts base v mf2021 when ukmethod[y] = proportional_credit and f = pit_o = (abolition_right[y] and abolition_use = used)

def nonres_from[p in person]: date
  note "MF, Przykład 9: the day of the move is the last day of unlimited liability; non-resident status starts the next day"
  rule base v mf2021 = centre_moved[p] + 1

def resident_at_departure[p in person]: bool
  note "art. 3 ust. 1a pkt 1: on the day he left to work abroad, the centre of vital interests was still in Poland"
  rule base v pit_2006 = (centre_from[p] = pol and work_abroad_from[p] < centre_moved[p])

def tax_after_credit[p in person, y in cy]: num PLN
  note "the tax after the deduction for UK tax. The health contribution (art. 27b), the ulga abolicyjna (art. 27g) and the rounding to whole złoty come after it; the source asks for no amount, so they are not written."
  rule base v mli_uk = tax_scale_all[p, y] - uk_credit[p, y]

def tax_scale_all[p in person, y in cy]: num PLN
  note "MLI art. 5 ust. 6, Opcja C: the tax computed before the deduction, by the scale of the year's law (art. 27 ust. 1 and 1a), on the whole base, the UK income included"
  rule base = scale(tax_base[p, y])

def tb_ca[p in person]: key state
  note "PL-CA convention art. 4 ust. 2 (a)-(d): a resident of both states is a resident only of the state these steps give, taken in this order; each step excepts the next, and the chain is transitive (LANGUAGE 5.10)"
  rule abode excepts nationality v upo_ca when abode[p, pol] != abode[p, can] = if abode[p, pol] then pol else can
  rule agreement v upo_ca = ? "Art. 4 ust. 2 (d): jeśli osoba fizyczna jest obywatelem obu Państw lub nie jest obywatelem żadnego z nich, właściwe organy Umawiających się Państw rozstrzygną sprawę w drodze wzajemnego porozumienia."
  rule home excepts vital v upo_ca when home[p, pol] != home[p, can] = if home[p, pol] then pol else can
  rule nationality excepts agreement v upo_ca when national[p, pol] != national[p, can] = if national[p, pol] then pol else can
  rule vital excepts abode v upo_ca when home[p, pol] and home[p, can] and closer[p, pol] != closer[p, can] = if closer[p, pol] then pol else can

def tb_es[p in person]: key state
  note "PL-ES agreement art. 4 ust. 2 a)-d): a resident of both states is a resident only of the state these steps give, taken in this order; each step excepts the next, and the chain is transitive (LANGUAGE 5.10)"
  rule abode excepts nationality v upo_es when abode[p, pol] != abode[p, esp] = if abode[p, pol] then pol else esp
  rule agreement v upo_es = ? "Art. 4 ust. 2 lit. d): jeżeli sytuacji tej osoby nie można określić zgodnie z postanowieniami litery c), właściwe władze Umawiających się Państw rozstrzygną zagadnienie w drodze wzajemnego porozumienia."
  rule home excepts vital v upo_es when home[p, pol] != home[p, esp] = if home[p, pol] then pol else esp
  rule nationality excepts agreement v upo_es when national[p, pol] != national[p, esp] = if national[p, pol] then pol else esp
  rule vital excepts abode v upo_es when home[p, pol] and home[p, esp] and closer[p, pol] != closer[p, esp] = if closer[p, pol] then pol else esp

def treaty_res[p in person]: key state
  note "art. 4a: art. 3 applies subject to the treaty with the other state that treats the person as its resident"
  rule ca when dual[p] and other_state[p] = can = tb_ca[p]
  rule es when dual[p] and other_state[p] = esp = tb_es[p]

def uk_credit[p in person, y in cy]: num PLN
  note "MLI art. 5 ust. 6, Opcja C: Poland deducts an amount equal to the UK tax, but no more than the part of the tax computed before the deduction that falls on the income taxable in the UK; the MF: w wysokości proporcjonalnie przypadającej na ten zagraniczny dochód"
  rule credit v mli_uk when ukmethod[y] = proportional_credit = min(tax_uk[p, y], tax_scale_all[p, y] * income_uk[p, y] / income_all[p, y])
  rule exemption v upo_uk when ukmethod[y] = exemption_progression = -

def ukmethod[y in cy]: key method
  note "PL-UK convention art. 22 ust. 2 lit. a): Poland exempts a resident's UK income, with progression. MLI art. 5 ust. 6 (Opcja C) replaces it with the proportional credit for Polish taxes levied for tax periods beginning on or after mli_from. The PIT tax period is the calendar year (MF section 2.2)."
  rule base v upo_uk = exemption_progression
  rule mli excepts base v mli_uk when start_of(y) >= mli_from = proportional_credit

def unlimited[p in person]: bool
  note "art. 3 ust. 1 with art. 4a: a Polish resident is taxed on all income, subject to the treaties; a resident of both states only if the treaty gives the residence to Poland"
  rule base v pit_2006 = domestic_res[p, pol] and (not dual[p] or treaty_res[p] = pol)

def unlimited_from[p in person]: date
  note "MF section 2.2 and Przykład 9: the calendar year is the tax period, so a resident from before the year is liable without limit from its first day"
  rule base v mf2021 = start_of(year_of(centre_moved[p]))

def unlimited_to[p in person]: date
  note "MF, Przykład 9: income up to the end of the day of the move is settled under unlimited liability"
  rule base v mf2021 = centre_moved[p]

ask q_p08_days: days_pl[julia, y] for y in cy with arrived[julia] = 2019-11-01

ask q_p08_long_stay: long_stay[julia, y] for y in cy

ask q_p09_left: left_pl[mariusz]

ask q_p09_moved: centre_moved[mariusz]

ask q_p09_nonres: nonres_from[mariusz]

ask q_p09_unlimited: unlimited_from[mariusz], unlimited_to[mariusz]

ask q_p10_departure: resident_at_departure[dawid]

ask q_p10_left: left_pl[dawid]

ask q_p10_moved: centre_moved[dawid]

ask q_p11_amounts: tax_scale_all[monika, 2020], uk_credit[monika, 2020], tax_after_credit[monika, 2020]

ask q_p11_change: method_change_day

ask q_p11_forms: must_file[f, 2020] for f in form

ask q_p11_method: ukmethod[y] for y in cy

ask q_p11_relief: abolition_right[2020]

ask q_p11_same: ukmethod[2020] = ukmethod[2019]

ask q_p12_dual: dual[renata]

ask q_p12_state: treaty_res[renata]

ask q_p12_unlimited: unlimited[renata]

ask q_p12_why: explain tb_es[renata]

ask q_p13_dual: dual[jakub]

ask q_p13_state: treaty_res[jakub]

ask q_p13_why: explain tb_ca[jakub]

version upo_es
  cite dz1982_127
  known 1982-06-18
  note "Art. 4 ust. 2 a)-d), read in the MF's synthesised text of the agreement with the MLI (https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/d0nlkedh/pl-es-konwencja-mli-tekst-syntetyczny-pl-es-kopia.pdf, pp. 7-8; a working document, not a source of law). The MLI doesn't touch art. 4 ust. 2: its art. 4 is on persons other than individuals. Known from promulgation, 1982-06-18 (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/1982/127, field promulgation); later protocols are not traced. Its lit. d) reads differently from the MF's general statement in section 3.1 (p. 11); neither example reaches it."

version pit_2006
  cite dz2006_1588
  governs 2007-01-01..
  known 2006-11-29
  note "art. 1 pkt 2 gives art. 3 ust. 1, 1a and 2a of the PIT act their wording, and pkt 3 art. 4a (Przepisy art. 3 ust. 1, 1a, 2a i 2b stosuje się z uwzględnieniem umów w sprawie unikania podwójnego opodatkowania); art. 22: in force 1 stycznia 2007 r., not among the exceptions. Known from promulgation, 2006-11-29 (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2006/1588, field promulgation)."
  note "The case reads art. 3 the same in Dz.U. 2020 poz. 1426 (p. 12), the text the MF cites, and in Dz.U. 2021 poz. 1128 (pp. 9-10); later amendments are not traced."
  stay_limit = 183 "art. 1 pkt 2 lit. b, art. 3 ust. 1a pkt 2: przebywa na terytorium Rzeczypospolitej Polskiej dłużej niż 183 dni w roku podatkowym (Dz.U. 2021 poz. 1128, p. 9)"

version upo_uk
  cite dz2006_1840
  known 2006-12-29
  note "Art. 22 ust. 2 lit. a): Polska zwolni taki dochód z opodatkowania, read in the MF's synthesised text with the MLI (https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/dmklglvr/upo-pl-uk-mli-tekst-syntetyczny-pl.pdf, pp. 22-23), which says of itself (p. 1): Niniejszy dokument w żadnym przypadku nie stanowi źródła prawa. Known from promulgation, 2006-12-29 (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2006/1840, field promulgation)."

version upo_ca
  cite dz2013_1371
  known 2013-11-25
  note "Art. 4 ust. 2 (a)-(d), read in the MF's synthesised text with the MLI (https://www.podatki.gov.pl/media/xt0fuutg/upo-pl-kanada-tekst-syntetyczny-mli-pl-tc.pdf, pp. 7-8; a working document, not a source of law). The MLI doesn't touch art. 4 ust. 2. Known from promulgation, 2013-11-25 (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2013/1371, field promulgation)."

version mli
  cite dz2018_1369
  known 2018-07-17
  note "art. 35 ust. 1 lit. b), and art. 5 ust. 6, Opcja C (synthesised PL-UK text, pp. 22-23). Known from promulgation, 2018-07-17 (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2018/1369, field promulgation), the day of the Dziennik Ustaw issue that also carries poz. 1370."

version mli_pl
  cite dz2018_1370
  known 2018-07-17
  note "Poland ratified the MLI on 4 stycznia 2018 r.; under its art. 34 ust. 1 it entered into force for Poland on 1 lipca 2018 r. Poland's notification under art. 5 ust. 10 chooses Opcja C. Known from promulgation: the Dziennik Ustaw is dated Warszawa, dnia 17 lipca 2018 r."
  mli_in_force[pol] = 2018-07-01 "Zgodnie z art. 34 ust. 1 Konwencji wchodzi ona w życie dnia 1 lipca 2018 r. w stosunku do Rzeczypospolitej Polskiej"

version mli_uk
  cite dz2018_2253
  known 2018-12-03
  note "The United Kingdom became a party to the MLI on 1 października 2018 r., and from that day the MLI applies to the PL-UK convention, so Opcja C replaces its art. 22 ust. 2 lit. a). Known from promulgation: the Dziennik Ustaw is dated Warszawa, dnia 3 grudnia 2018 r."
  note "The synthesised PL-UK text prints the date that follows from these two days under art. 35 ust. 1 lit. b) (p. 2)."
  mli_in_force[gbr] = 2018-10-01 "Zjednoczone Królestwo Wielkiej Brytanii i Irlandii Północnej stało się dnia 1 października 2018 r. stroną wyżej wymienionej Konwencji"

version pit_2019
  cite dz2019_1835
  governs 2020-01-01..
  known 2019-09-26
  note "art. 1 pkt 3 lit. a gives art. 27 ust. 1 and 1a their wording; art. 7 ust. 2 applies them to income from 1 stycznia 2020 r. Known from promulgation: the Dziennik Ustaw is dated Warszawa, dnia 26 września 2019 r. (ELI API, api.sejm.gov.pl/eli/acts/DU/2019/1835, field promulgation)."
  kz: [0, 8000] = kz_full "art. 27 ust. 1a pkt 1: dla podstawy obliczenia podatku nieprzekraczającej kwoty 8000 zł"
  kz: (8000, 13000] = kz_full - 834.88 * (x - band_lo(kz, x)) / 5000 "art. 27 ust. 1a pkt 2: 1360 zł pomniejszone o 834 zł 88 gr × (podstawa obliczenia podatku – 8000 zł) ÷ 5000 zł"
  kz: (13000, 85528] = 525.12 "art. 27 ust. 1a pkt 3: 525 zł 12 gr"
  kz: (85528, 127000] = 525.12 - 525.12 * (x - band_lo(kz, x)) / 41472 "art. 27 ust. 1a pkt 4: 525 zł 12 gr pomniejszone o 525 zł 12 gr × (podstawa obliczenia podatku – 85 528 zł) ÷ 41 472 zł"
  kz: (127000, inf) = ? "art. 27 ust. 1a for a base above 127 000 zł is not in the case"
  kz_full = 1360 "art. 27 ust. 1a pkt 1: 1360 zł"
  scale: [0, 85528] = 0.17 * x - kz(x) "art. 27 ust. 1, first bracket: do 85 528, 17% minus kwota zmniejszająca podatek"
  scale: (85528, inf) = 14539.76 + 0.32 * (x - band_lo(scale, x)) - kz(x) "art. 27 ust. 1, second bracket: 14 539 zł 76 gr + 32% nadwyżki ponad 85 528 zł, minus kwota zmniejszająca podatek"

version mf2021
  cite mf_objasnienia
  known 2021-04-29
  note "The guidance is dated 29 April 2021. It cites the PIT act as Dz. U. z 2020 r. poz. 1426, z późn. zm. (footnote 1). Its rules are cited here; its examples' facts are in version mf_examples."

version mf_examples
  cite mf_objasnienia
  known 2026-10-19
  note "The facts and findings of Przykłady 8-13 are a hypothetical case's stipulations, known from the model's on date (LANGUAGE 4.5; the model has no start), as are the assumptions that stand for what the examples leave unsaid."
  abode[jakub, pol] = true assumed "the source says only that his days in each state are not decisive; half a year in each is read as an habitual abode in both (an abode in neither would lead to nationality too)" "p. 12, Przykład 13: ilość dni pobytu pana Jakuba w każdym z państw nie jest rozstrzygająca"
  abode[jakub, can] = true assumed "the source says only that his days in each state are not decisive; half a year in each is read as an habitual abode in both (an abode in neither would lead to nationality too)" "p. 12, Przykład 13: ilość dni pobytu pana Jakuba w każdym z państw nie jest rozstrzygająca"
  arrived[julia] = 2019-11 "p. 8, Przykład 8: w listopadzie 2019 r. (the day is not stated)"
  centre_from[mariusz] = pol "p. 8, Przykład 9: opuścił wynajmowane mieszkanie ostatniego dnia maja tego roku i w tym dniu przeniósł się do Wielkiej Brytanii"
  centre_from[dawid] = pol "p. 9, Przykład 10: wciąż posiadał centrum interesów osobistych w Polsce"
  centre_to[mariusz] = gbr "p. 8, Przykład 9: Od tego czasu ośrodek interesów życiowych pana Mariusza znajduje się w Wielkiej Brytanii."
  centre_to[dawid] = swe "p. 9, Przykład 10: do tego państwa został przeniesiony jego ośrodek interesów życiowych"
